# lang-go — Go developer toolchain (FETCHED-ONLINE, never baked). Official-repo
# Go compiler + the LSP and debugger, plus an OPT-IN `mise:go` runtime directive
# for users who prefer a mise-managed Go version alongside the system `go`.
# `iictl pack install lang-go` fetches the members online and records the set
# for an exact, reversible `iictl pack remove lang-go`.
#meta:type lang
go
gopls
delve

# Opt-in mise-managed Go runtime (engine runs `mise use -g go`; inverse on remove).
mise:go
